{"1372330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PRESS: Authorized Disposal", "steam_appid": 1372330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4917150], "detailed_description": "<h1>Do your job!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/def8cdac304baf7d36295916cd0ea71c.poster.avif?t=1787048571\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/def8cdac304baf7d36295916cd0ea71c.webm?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/def8cdac304baf7d36295916cd0ea71c.mp4?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/21ceb09941201f7a2be17ab090672d95.poster.avif?t=1787048571\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/21ceb09941201f7a2be17ab090672d95.webm?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/21ceb09941201f7a2be17ab090672d95.mp4?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Job</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press it, burn it, and sort it - complete your contracts, collect your pay. Spend your earnings on cores to upgrade your operation: speed up the press, the pusher, the pit burn rate, or boost your disposal income. The loads keep coming. Stay ahead of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One rule:</strong> keep the pit empty. If it fills, it's over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/2f468c78876966e775e168f708407481.poster.avif?t=1787048571\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/2f468c78876966e775e168f708407481.webm?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/2f468c78876966e775e168f708407481.mp4?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Trash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash is trash. Press it, burn it, sort it, move on. You're not paid to ask what it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/f5ccf7da2fb49616ba1a9b6cb474f06d.poster.avif?t=1787048571\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/f5ccf7da2fb49616ba1a9b6cb474f06d.webm?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/f5ccf7da2fb49616ba1a9b6cb474f06d.mp4?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PRESS: Authorized Disposal is a one-sitting experience (2–3 hours). A disposal factory. A suspicious employer. Trash that shouldn't exist. Not a roguelite. Not really a story. Just the job.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/21ceb09941201f7a2be17ab090672d95.poster.avif?t=1787048571\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/21ceb09941201f7a2be17ab090672d95.webm?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/21ceb09941201f7a2be17ab090672d95.mp4?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Job</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press it, burn it, and sort it - complete your contracts, collect your pay. Spend your earnings on cores to upgrade your operation: speed up the press, the pusher, the pit burn rate, or boost your disposal income. The loads keep coming. Stay ahead of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One rule:</strong> keep the pit empty. If it fills, it's over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/2f468c78876966e775e168f708407481.poster.avif?t=1787048571\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/2f468c78876966e775e168f708407481.webm?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/2f468c78876966e775e168f708407481.mp4?t=1787048571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Trash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash is trash. Press it, burn it, sort it, move on. You're not paid to ask what it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372330/extras/f5ccf7da2fb49616ba1a9b6cb474f06d.poster.avif?t=1787048571\" width=1170 height=314 ><sou